      "en": "In his hand are the deep places of the earth. The heights of the mountains are also his.",
      "ko": "땅의 깊은 곳이 그 위에 있으며 산들의 높은 것도 그의 것이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "b741d9febdab5c2bfc2382946d15ba8b7b49c1a89617949c342171345ea2ed99",
      "translation_text_hash": "992e0f536cbbc87795d49f45fbc3de83b9871f5feb399695bad49db5d4b1977b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
